    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to DECON Protocol!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into sci-fi alien worlds where you deconstruct aliens into parts to upgrade your base.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt to wipe out the Aliens plaguing each planet and build your base and DECON Unit to produce higher outputs, more damage, more gains, and JUST MORE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DECON Protocol offers a challenge to see what heights you can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/f7728b7fb212df1fa3ca845c7ff7fa7d.poster.avif?t=1754002854\" width=768 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/f7728b7fb212df1fa3ca845c7ff7fa7d.webm?t=1754002854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/f7728b7fb212df1fa3ca845c7ff7fa7d.mp4?t=1754002854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several Overlapping Systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deconstruct aliens to gather their pieces and parts in order to upgrade a multitude of systems including: Employee Training, DECON upgrades, DECON Overclocking, Gene Splicing, Studies that grant buffs, Missions, Geode Mines, Toxic Waste trading, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/eaf7551144b785255d9af76bea300632.avif?t=1754002854\" width=800 height=1014 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most systems reset on Wormhole (Prestige), but many also have a SPECIALIZATION BAR which grants permanent upgrades for each system that carry through prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/3fe0436ee3357c6e2e8eb86ee15f743c.avif?t=1754002854\" width=604 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also daily login bonuses, weekly login bonuses, extra idle gains while playing that store in a chest, and offline progression and gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/4d8a03f8efb1282315cc60d3de8d8eff.avif?t=1754002854\" data-has-big width=800 height=566 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your own base today and wipe out the alien scourge overwhelming the planets in your sector!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to DECON Protocol!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME DESCRIPTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into sci-fi alien worlds where you deconstruct aliens into parts to upgrade your base.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt to wipe out the Aliens plaguing each planet and build your base and DECON Unit to produce higher outputs, more damage, more gains, and JUST MORE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DECON Protocol offers a challenge to see what heights you can reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/f7728b7fb212df1fa3ca845c7ff7fa7d.poster.avif?t=1754002854\" width=768 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/f7728b7fb212df1fa3ca845c7ff7fa7d.webm?t=1754002854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/f7728b7fb212df1fa3ca845c7ff7fa7d.mp4?t=1754002854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several Overlapping Systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deconstruct aliens to gather their pieces and parts in order to upgrade a multitude of systems including: Employee Training, DECON upgrades, DECON Overclocking, Gene Splicing, Studies that grant buffs, Missions, Geode Mines, Toxic Waste trading, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/eaf7551144b785255d9af76bea300632.avif?t=1754002854\" width=800 height=1014 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most systems reset on Wormhole (Prestige), but many also have a SPECIALIZATION BAR which grants permanent upgrades for each system that carry through prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/3fe0436ee3357c6e2e8eb86ee15f743c.avif?t=1754002854\" width=604 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also daily login bonuses, weekly login bonuses, extra idle gains while playing that store in a chest, and offline progression and gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778410/extras/4d8a03f8efb1282315cc60d3de8d8eff.avif?t=1754002854\" data-has-big width=800 height=566 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your own base today and wipe out the alien scourge overwhelming the planets in your sector!</h2>",
    "short_description": "Dive into sci-fi alien worlds where you wipe out Alien scourge by deconstructing them into parts to upgrade your base and your DECON unit, allowing you to produce higher outputs, more damage, more gains, and JUST MORE. DECON PROTOCOL is an incremental game with idle and clicker mechanics.",
